WEBVTT

1
00:00:54.863 --> 00:00:56.033
<v><b>Ben &#x0026; Izzy:</b></v> Sorry!

2
00:01:03.384 --> 00:01:04.354
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Good morning.

3
00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.351
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi. I have a reservation for four nights.

4
00:01:08.408 --> 00:01:10.277
My name is Ben Fischer.

5
00:01:10.805 --> 00:01:12.689
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Can you spell your surname, please?

6
00:01:12.975 --> 00:01:19.226
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, it’s F-I-S-C-H-E-R.

7
00:01:20.211 --> 00:01:22.309
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Can I have your passport, please?

8
00:01:22.908 --> 00:01:23.593
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Just a moment.

9
00:01:34.169 --> 00:01:35.140
Here you go.

10
00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.239
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Thank you.

11
00:01:39.136 --> 00:01:40.806
Can you sign here, Mr Fischer?

12
00:01:41.691 --> 00:01:42.376
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Sure.

13
00:01:45.887 --> 00:01:47.928
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Thank you. Here’s your key.

14
00:01:47.985 --> 00:01:51.603
It’s room twelve, on the second floor. The lift is over there.

15
00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:55.449
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> The lift? Oh, the elevator.

16
00:01:55.564 --> 00:01:57.776
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Yes. Would you like a map of London?

17
00:01:58.233 --> 00:01:59.517
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, please.

18
00:02:00.559 --> 00:02:03.513
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Here you are. Enjoy your stay, Mr Fischer.

19
00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:04.769
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.